  CA 90041
URL:https://vidiotsfoundation.org/purchase/4337912/
DESCRIPTION:Run time: 90 min\n\nSeries: In the MUBI Microcinema\n\nGet your
  eyes and ears ready for our latest 16mm installment of celluloid obscurit
 ies Rare Notes\, a program ranging from the 1920s - 1970s of offbeat music
 al masterpieces\, curiosities\, and cartoons. From blues and jazz to funk 
 and prog rock\, this smorgasbord of sounds will move you and get you movin
 g!\n\nTickets: https://vidiotsfoundation.org/purchase/4337912/\n\nDetails:
  https://vidiotsfoundation.org/movies/sweet-16mm-rare-notes/
END:VEVENT
