 owerful depiction of human behavior in the face of death\, positioned on t
 he borders between reality and nightmare\, tranquillity and terror.\n\nTic
 kets: https://vidiotsfoundation.org/purchase/4270604/\n\nDetails: https://
 vidiotsfoundation.org/movies/cries-and-whispers/
